# Inkmoth Nexus animated ("becomes a 1/1 Phyrexian Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying and infect until end of turn.
# It's still a land."), then Blood Moon. The animation is a resolved ability's effect, not an ability of the land (CR 305.7:
# "this doesn't remove any abilities that were granted to the land by other effects", nor any card type), so under the Moon
# it is still a 1/1 Artifact Land Creature with flying and infect; its creature types stay and its land type is now
# Mountain (the Moon sets land types only). It attacks and gives Bot2 a poison counter. Its own "{T}: Add {C}" and its
# animation ability are gone: on turn 5, the animation over (CR 514.2), it is a plain Land - Mountain that cannot become a
# creature again and taps for {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Inkmoth Nexus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Blood Moon
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

